+
+// vfr hold (Golem, misc:vfr_hold_ms): the monitors whose only damage since their last frame is
+// what a screen share asked for (its frame's copy, ScreenshareFrame::share). That is not the
+// screen changing: counted, every copy a client asked for began the hold again, and with one
+// that samples the screen a few times a second (the dock) the panel never left its full rate.
+// Taken out at any other damage (CMonitor::addDamage) and at every frame (renderMonitor).
+extern std::unordered_set<const CMonitor*> g_vfrHoldShareOnly;
diff --git a/src/managers/screenshare/ScreenshareFrame.cpp b/src/managers/screenshare/ScreenshareFrame.cpp
index 438d828..f97bc71 100644
--- a/src/managers/screenshare/ScreenshareFrame.cpp
